<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 16.0px 0.0px; color:#1a1a1a; font-size:16.0px"><b>ayaṃ</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>vāyuḥ</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>sarveṣāṃ</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>bhūtānāṃ</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>madhvasya</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>vāyoḥ</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>sarvāṇi</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>bhūtāni</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>madhu</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>yaścāyamasminvāyau</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>tejomayo'mṛtamayaḥ</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>puruṣo</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>yaścāyamadhyātmaṃ</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>prāṇastejomayo'mṛtamayaḥ</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>puruṣo'yameva</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>sa</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>yo'yamātmedamamṛtamidaṃ</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>brahmedaṃ</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>sarvam</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> </b></span><b>॥</b><span style="font-size:16.0px"><b> 2-5-4 </b></span><b>॥</b><b></b></p>
<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#1a1a1a; font-size:16.0px">tathā<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>vāyuḥ<span style="font-size:16.0px">, </span>adhyātmaṃ<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>prāṇaḥ<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>|<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>bhūtānāṃ<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>śarīrārambhakatvenopakārāt<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>madhutvam<span style="font-size:16.0px"> ; </span>tadantargatānāṃ<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>tejomayādīnāṃ<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>karaṇatvenopakārānmadhutvam<span style="font-size:16.0px"> ; </span>tathā<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>coktam<span style="font-size:16.0px"> — <a style="color:inherit" href="https://advaitasharada.sringeri.net/display/bhashya/Brha/devanagari?page=1&amp;id=BR_C01_S05_V11&amp;hl=%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%B8%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%AF%E0%A5%88%20%E0%A4%B5%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%9A%E0%A4%83%20%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%83%E0%A4%A5%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B5%E0%A5%80%20%E0%A4%B6%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%80%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%82%20%E0%A4%9C%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%AF%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%82%E0%A4%AA%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%97%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%83"><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">‘</span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">tasyai</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">vācaḥ</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">pṛthivī</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">śarīraṃ</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">jyotirūpamayamagniḥ</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoratio