<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#1a1a1a; font-size:16.0px">tametamartham<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>etau<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>mantrāvanuvadataḥ<span style="font-size:16.0px"> — <a style="color:inherit" href="https://advaitasharada.sringeri.net/display/bhashya/Isha/devanagari?page=1&amp;id=IS_C01_V04&amp;hl=%E0%A4%85%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%9C%E0%A4%A6%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%82%20%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%B8%E0%A5%8B%20%E0%A4%9C%E0%A4%B5%E0%A5%80%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%83"><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">‘</span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">anejadekaṃ</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">manaso</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">javīyaḥ</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">’ (</span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">ī</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">. </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">u</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">. </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">4</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">)</span></a> <a style="color:inherit" href="https://advaitasharada.sringeri.net/display/bhashya/Isha/devanagari?page=1&amp;id=IS_C01_V05&amp;hl=%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%A6%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%9C%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%BF%20%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%88%E0%A4%9C%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%BF"><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">‘</span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">tadejati</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-deco