<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px"><span style="color:#1a1a1a">आथर्वणे</span><span style="color:#1a1a1a; font-size:16.0px"> </span><span style="color:#1a1a1a">च</span><span style="color:#1a1a1a; font-size:16.0px">  <a style="color:inherit" href="https://advaitasharada.sringeri.net/display/bhashya/Mundaka/devanagari?page=1&amp;id=MD_C01_S01_V09&amp;hl=%E0%A4%B8%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B5%E0%A4%9C%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%9E%E0%A4%83%20%E0%A4%B8%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B5%E0%A4%B5%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8D"><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">‘</span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">सर्वज्ञः</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">सर्ववित्</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">’ (</span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">मु</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">. </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">उ</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">. </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">१</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">।</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">१</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">।</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">९</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">)</span></a></span><span style="color:#1a1a1a; font-size:16.0px">, </span><span style="color:#1a1a1a; font-size:16.0px"> <a style="color:inherit" href="https://advaitasharada.sringeri.net/display/bhashya/Mundaka/devanagari?page=3&amp;id=MD_C03_S01_V07&amp;hl=%E0%A4%A6%E0%A5%82%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B8%E0%A5%81%E0%A4%A6%E0%A5%82%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%87%20%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%A6%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B9%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%87%20%E0%A4%9A"><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">‘</span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">दूरात्सुदूरे</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">तदिहान्तिके</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">च</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">’ (</span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">मु</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">. </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">उ</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">. </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">३</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">।</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">१</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">।</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">७</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">)</span></a> </span><span style="color:#1a1a1a">।</span></p>
<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#1a1a1a; font-size:16.0px"> </p>
<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px"><span style="color:#1a1a1a">कठवल्लीष्वपि</span><span style="color:#1a1a1a; font-size:16.0px"> <a style="color:inherit" href="https://advaitasharada.sringeri.net/display/bhashya/Kathaka/devanagari?page=1&amp;id=Ka_C01_S02_V21&amp;hl=%E0%A4%85%E0%A4%A3%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%A3%E0%A5%80%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%B9%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8B%20%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%B9%E0%A5%80%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%8D"><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">‘</span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">अणोरणीयान्महतो</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">महीयान्</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">’ (</span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">क</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">. </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">उ</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">. </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">१</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">।</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">२</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">।</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">२१</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">)</span></a> <a style="color:inherit" href="https://advaitasharada.sringeri.net/display/bhashya/Kathaka/devanagari?page=1&amp;id=Ka_C01_S02_V21&amp;hl=%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%B8%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%82%20%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%A6%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%A6%E0%A4%82%20%E0%A4%A6%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%B5%E0%A4%82"><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">‘</span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">कस्तं</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">मदामदं</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">देवं</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">’ (</span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">क</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">. </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">उ</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">. </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">१</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">।</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">२</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">।</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline"> </span><span style="color:#0000ff; font-size:16.0px; text-decoration:underline">२१</span><span style="color:#0000ff; text-decoration:underline">)</span></a> <a style="color:inherit" href="https://advaitasharada.sringeri.net/display/bhashya/Isha/devanagari?page=1&amp;id=IS_C01_V04&amp;hl=%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%A6%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A7%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%B5%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%BD%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%AF%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%A4%E0